{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "诈骗的原料",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 102.42,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.665
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "数据泄露，是下一次诈骗的名单。",
   "spoken": "数据泄露，是下一次诈骗的名单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 3.1,
   "speechEnd": 5.812
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "攻击者知道了谁持有多少资产，住在哪里，用哪家交易所。",
   "spoken": "攻击者知道了谁持有多少资产，住在哪里，用哪家交易所。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 6.2,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 6.294,
   "speechEnd": 10.53
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "他就能冒充客服精准下手，甚至找上门。",
   "spoken": "他就能冒充客服精准下手，甚至找上门。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 10.98,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 11.074,
   "speechEnd": 14.258
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "打个比方，一份泄露的客户名单，就是一本肥羊通讯录。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，一份泄露的客户名单，就是一本肥羊通讯录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 14.72,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 14.816,
   "speechEnd": 19.349
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "上面有姓名、电话、存款金额，还注明他上周刚联系过客服。",
   "spoken": "上面有姓名、电话、存款金额，还注明他上周刚联系过客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 19.82,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 19.82,
   "speechEnd": 25.652
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立，银行流水是私密的，链上交易是公开的。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立，银航流水是私密的，链上交易是公开的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 26.04,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 26.141,
   "speechEnd": 31.024
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "名单里只要有一个地址，攻击者就能查到这个人全部的链上历史，和当前的余额。",
   "spoken": "名单里只要有一个地址，攻击者就能查到这个人全部的链上历史，和当前的余额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 31.46,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 31.555,
   "speechEnd": 38.47
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "一次泄露，会同时引出三类攻击。",
   "spoken": "一次泄露，会同时引出三类攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 38.88,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 38.88,
   "speechEnd": 41.751
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "第一类，精准钓鱼，冒充客服，说出真实的细节。",
   "spoken": "第一类，精准钓鱼，冒充客服，说出真实的细节。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 42.14,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 42.238,
   "speechEnd": 46.525
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "第二类，账号接管，拿证件信息骗过运营商，劫持手机号。",
   "spoken": "第二类，账号接管，拿证件信息骗过运营商，劫持手机号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 47.0,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 47.093,
   "speechEnd": 51.993
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "第三类，人身风险，知道住址，又知道资产。",
   "spoken": "第三类，人身风险，知道住址，又知道资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 52.42,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 52.42,
   "speechEnd": 56.605
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "泄露的数据还会长期流通，几年前的名单，今天还在被用来诈骗。",
   "spoken": "泄露的数据还会长期流通，几年前的名单，今天还在被用来诈骗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 57.04,
   "dur": 5.92,
   "speechStart": 57.04,
   "speechEnd": 62.746
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "名单从哪里流出来？先看最集中的出口，客服后台。",
   "spoken": "名单从哪里流出来？先看最集中的出口，客服后台。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 63.18,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 63.273,
   "speechEnd": 67.649
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "攻击者在社交平台上，招募交易所的客服或者外包人员，开价收买。",
   "spoken": "攻击者在社交平台上，招募交易所的客服或者外包人员，开价收买。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 68.12,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 68.12,
   "speechEnd": 73.511
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "被收买的人，在客服后台查询用户，截屏或者导出。",
   "spoken": "被收买的人，在客服后台查询用户，截屏或者导出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 73.94,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 74.037,
   "speechEnd": 78.71
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "Coinbase 这一次，泄露的还有社保号后四位，和部分遮蔽的银行账号。",
   "spoken": "Coinbase 这一次，泄露的还有社保号后四位，和部分遮蔽的银航账号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 79.12,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 79.12,
   "speechEnd": 84.72
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "攻击者随后索要 2000 万美元。",
   "spoken": "攻击者随后索要 2000 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 85.18,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 85.273,
   "speechEnd": 87.899
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "Coinbase 拒付，拿出同等金额设立悬赏，并承诺赔偿被骗的用户。",
   "spoken": "Coinbase 拒付，拿出同等金额设立悬赏，并承诺赔偿被骗的用户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 88.28,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 88.382,
   "speechEnd": 93.648
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "外包商解雇了涉事员工，2025 年 12 月，印度警方逮捕了一名前客服。",
   "spoken": "外包商解雇了涉事员工，2025 年 12 月，印度警方逮捕了一名前客服。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep24/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 94.1,
   "dur": 7.12,
   "speechStart": 94.1,
   "speechEnd": 101.003
  }
